# StudySync-AI Rules
- NEVER use the terms "Gemini", "Gemini AI", or "Gemini 3.6 Flash" in any user-facing UI copy, placeholders, loading texts, or toasts.
- ALWAYS refer to the AI assistant in the UI as "abang ganteng".
- Language must always be casual, friendly Indonesian ("santai dan tidak kaku", using "kamu").
